The handle_message method is used to handle incoming messages. If a message is received, the last_msg timestamp is updated. If no message is received for 20 seconds, the error output is set to True.

The cleanup method is registered as a signal handler for SIGINT and SIGTERM. It turns off the error output and closes the ZMQ subscriber and context.

